  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759869,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 16-Bit Rhythm Land: A Nostalgic Journey Through Gaming History\n\nStep back into the golden age of gaming with *16-Bit Rhythm Land*, a captivating rhythm game exclusively for the Sega Mega Drive/Genesis! This unique cassette delivers a vibrant experience, immersing players in a world of iconic 16-bit music. Featuring four distinct games, the title boasts a total of 20 beloved tracks, meticulously recreated using the authentic FM sound source – a hallmark of classic games and PCs.\n\nDeveloped with a deep reverence for gaming history, *16-Bit Rhythm Land* enlists a specialist composer renowned for his work on legendary game soundtracks, ensuring an authentic and nostalgic feel.  Beyond the music, the game's striking package art is crafted by a celebrated designer known for their work on famous titles. \n\nPrepare to tap, press, and groove your way through challenging levels, testing your rhythm and reflexes. Whether you're a seasoned FM sound source enthusiast or simply a fan of classic gaming, *16-Bit Rhythm Land* offers a delightful and engaging experience that celebrates the sounds and style of the 16-bit era."
    },
